#39500
Credits Room - Plains of Xev~
This is a connector zone and the beginning of the new eastern hemisphere.  It
links to the Reggid Ocean 39680 at 39683 and Mt Everwar at 27601.  Corwin
~
395 0 0 0 0 0 255 0
S
#39501
The Plains of Xev~
You see before you a vast plain of grasslands that sweeps to the east
as far as the eye can see. The grassy plains are dotted with small clumps
of trees and here and there low rolling hills break up the flat ocean of grass.
~
