#39525
The Plains of Xev~
You see before you a vast plain of grasslands that sweeps to the north and
south as far as the eye can see.  To the east a stream roughly eight to ten
feet wide wanders lazily across the plains.  Its banks are cut level with the
surrounding grass making it nearly invisible unless you are standing right on
top of it.    
~
