The Break In The Cliffs~
You look back out across your shoulder at an ocean whose waters range in color
from a light, dappled, bluish-green to an intense dark emerald green.  The
waves roll from horizon to horizon in long slow swells.  Ahead of you lies a
vast undulating plain that stretches to the horizon.    
~
